Review marker for the phi transport-consistency C_k functional-embedding packet.

The review accepts only the admissibility-rule interpretation of the transport
route: C_transport^phi = 0. It keeps the multiplier/action route blocked, keeps
the penalty route not licensed, blocks direct dynamical-law interpretation,
executes no C_k variation, proves no transport consistency or full route
alignment, claims no phi generation or V(phi) derivation, closes no QFT-GR
seam, and promotes no master action. It authorizes only the bounded transport
admissibility-rule closeout packet.
-/

